Data exploration and analysis for hosuehold survey data from MG_LCLUC project.

/scripts:
1_data_import.R: this script subsets the full dataset and renames complicated column names.
Exports the subset to an RData file: MGSurvey

2_summary_sats.R: some basic initial data exploration

